  "prompt_sha256": "883bbd7a6f7905000c69e0478d3285ad3d7fdd8b3ad05d3e333af86330eeb156",
  "exact_prompt": "Use case: precise-object-edit. Asset: existing painted game diffuse texture. Faithful subtle HD paint refinement, preserving source appearance/material and every UV position; not a photographed or rendered replacement object.\r\n\r\nInput: sole opaque storedRGB reference is the ENTIRE original source nearest-enlarged to maximum dimension512. Output the complete same-aspect canvas with all original framing, count, scale, relative light and dark, no border/crop/padding/zoom/reposition.\r\n\r\nNative64x128, guide256x512. Keep complete original tall gray-metal painted atlas: large central gray rectangle with narrow faint gray outline, its one tiny dark horizontal mark, two small faint dark upper-side patterned fields, all lower dark/brown fields and slim pale lower edges. Two tiny source pattern fields at native[5,15,15,28] and[49,15,59,28] must stay faint exactly as reference. The left field has3 measured interior light maxima: row20 x9/11/13; row21 x8/10/12; row22,23,25 x9/11/13. Preserve source irregularities, exact2pixel pitch/phase where present, no idealized grid. Do not promote tiny low-contrast paint into larger bright holes, screws, stipple or engraving. Keep every existing dark mark weak and soft.\r\n\r\nMaterials: subdued original matte gray/bluegray/olive/darkbrown painted palette and fine source grain. Add only extremely subtle finer paint within original appearance, keeping original broad shade and soft edges, every weak narrow source mark dark/dim. No new etched/photographic grain, white raised rim/bevel, gold shine/gloss, coarse wood/leather, larger checker cells, new scratches/creases/stitches or invented hardware/part detail. Keep original local paint brightness hierarchy; do not turn source shadow into a new physical feature.\r\n\r\nConstraints: every source visible band, patterned field, tiny pale/dark mark, circular paint and gap retains original position/size/count/phase. No additional glyph/text/numbers/logo/fastener/hole/pin/groove/line or geometry. Entire opaque RGB texture only; engine retains/restores full original alpha separately. Do not rearrange UV sections or complete missing parts; preserve original imperfect source paint exactly.",
